Package: betabinomialRepeated
Type: Package
Title: Beta-Binomial Regression with Repeated Measures and Binomial Fallback
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tongjun", "Gu", email = "tgu@versiti.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits site-wise beta-binomial generalized linear mixed models for
    binomial count data with optional subject-level repeated-measure random
    intercepts and automatic binomial fallback. Provides coefficient-scale and
    response-scale delta-method contrasts and comparison tables.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
